[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Sailplay
Comment=Choose apps for the CarPlay display
Comment[zh_CN]=选择车机主页显示的应用
Comment[zh_TW]=選擇車機主畫面顯示的應用程式
Comment[de]=Apps für das CarPlay-Display auswählen
Comment[fr]=Choisir les applications de l’écran CarPlay
Comment[ru]=Выбор приложений для экрана CarPlay
Icon=harbour-sailplay
Exec=/usr/bin/invoker --type=silica-qt5 -s -n -d 5 /opt/sailplay/carui/carui /opt/sailplay/carui/mobile-settings.qml
X-Nemo-Application-Type=silica-qt5
